 ['Client DMs and booking requests.', 'Years of transformation content.', 'Affiliate links and discounts in the bio.', 'Programmes sold through the profile.'],
 ['Your business or coaching website.', 'The notice, with the date and any named post.', 'A list of the content you think was flagged.', 'The email and phone linked to the account.'],
